 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 dcraw,
 yelp,
Description: image viewer, browser and editor
 Pix is Linux Mint's image browser and editor, based on gThumb. It can
 browse folders, organize photos, show metadata, and edit images with tools
 for cropping, scaling and color adjustment. Built-in extensions add image
 format support, batch operations, slideshows and camera import.

Package: pix-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: architecture independent files for Pix
 Pix is Linux Mint's image viewer, browser and editor.
 .
 This package contains its translations, help pages, icons, schemas
 and other shared resources.

Package: pix-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 libgtk-3-dev,
 pix (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: development files for Pix extensions
 Pix is Linux Mint's image viewer, browser and editor.
 .
 This package contains the headers, pkg-config metadata and Autoconf
 macro used to develop third-party Pix extensions.
